{
  "version": "2",
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "title_main_001",
      "text": "三角函数不用背",
      "segment_type": "title_main",
      "audio_request": null,
      "explicit": false,
      "section_context": "",
      "marker_data": null
    },
    {
      "id": "title_sub_001",
      "text": "一个圆，讲透正弦和余弦",
      "segment_type": "title_sub",
      "audio_request": null,
      "explicit": false,
      "section_context": "",
      "marker_data": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hook_001",
      "text": "公式背了又忘？今天不背公式，只看一张图。",
      "segment_type": "content",
      "audio_request": {
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
        "speed": 1.0,
        "format": "wav"
      },
      "explicit": false,
      "section_context": "开场",
      "marker_data": null
    },
    {
      "id": "circle_header_001",
      "text": "从一个圆开始",
      "segment_type": "section_header",
      "audio_request": {
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
        "speed": 1.0,
        "format": "wav"
      },
      "explicit": false,
      "section_context": "从一个圆开始",
      "marker_data": null
    },
    {
      "id": "circle_draw_001",
      "text": "先画一个单位圆，半径等于一。",
      "segment_type": "content",
      "audio_request": {
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
        "speed": 1.0,
        "format": "wav"
      },
      "explicit": false,
      "section_context": "从一个圆开始",
      "marker_data": null
    },
    {
      "id": "circle_point_001",
      "text": "想象圆上有一个点，从最右边出发，逆时针转圈。",
      "segment_type": "content",
      "audio_request": {
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
        "speed": 1.0,
        "format": "wav"
      },
      "explicit": false,
      "section_context": "从一个圆开始",
      "marker_data": null
    },
    {
      "id": "sine_header_001",
      "text": "正弦：点的高度",
      "segment_type": "section_header",
      "audio_request": {
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
        "speed": 1.0,
        "format": "wav"
      },
      "explicit": false,
      "section_context": "正弦是高度",
      "marker_data": null
    },
    {
      "id": "sine_watch_001",
      "text": "现在，盯住这个点的高度。",
      "segment_type": "content",
      "audio_request": {
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
        "speed": 1.0,
        "format": "wav"
      },
      "explicit": false,
      "section_context": "正弦是高度",
      "marker_data": null
    },
    {
      "id": "sine_draw_001",
      "text": "把高度画成曲线，这就是正弦。",
      "segment_type": "content",
      "audio_request": {
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
        "speed": 1.0,
        "format": "wav"
      },
      "explicit": false,
      "section_context": "正弦是高度",
      "marker_data": null
    },
    {
      "id": "sine_peak_001",
      "text": "点转到最高处，波峰出现；回到起点，曲线归零。",
      "segment_type": "content",
      "audio_request": {
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
        "speed": 1.0,
        "format": "wav"
      },
      "explicit": false,
      "section_context": "正弦是高度",
      "marker_data": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cos_header_001",
      "text": "余弦：水平的位置",
      "segment_type": "section_header",
      "audio_request": {
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
        "speed": 1.0,
        "format": "wav"
      },
      "explicit": false,
      "section_context": "余弦是水平位置",
      "marker_data": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cos_watch_001",
      "text": "换个方向，这次盯住点的水平位置。",
      "segment_type": "content",
      "audio_request": {
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
        "speed": 1.0,
        "format": "wav"
      },
      "explicit": false,
      "section_context": "余弦是水平位置",
      "marker_data": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cos_draw_001",
      "text": "把水平位置画成曲线，这就是余弦。",
      "segment_type": "content",
      "audio_request": {
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
        "speed": 1.0,
        "format": "wav"
      },
      "explicit": false,
      "section_context": "余弦是水平位置",
      "marker_data": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cos_shift_001",
      "text": "它和正弦形状一样，只是向左挪了四分之一个圆。",
      "segment_type": "content",
      "audio_request": {
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
        "speed": 1.0,
        "format": "wav"
      },
      "explicit": false,
      "section_context": "余弦是水平位置",
      "marker_data": null
    },
    {
      "id": "sum_header_001",
      "text": "收进三句话",
      "segment_type": "section_header",
      "audio_request": {
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
        "speed": 1.0,
        "format": "wav"
      },
      "explicit": false,
      "section_context": "收进三句话",
      "marker_data": null
    },
    {
      "id": "sum_001",
      "text": "单位圆上，一个点转圈。",
      "segment_type": "content",
      "audio_request": {
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
        "speed": 1.0,
        "format": "wav"
      },
      "explicit": false,
      "section_context": "收进三句话",
      "marker_data": null
    },
    {
      "id": "sum_002",
      "text": "点的高度，画出来是正弦。",
      "segment_type": "content",
      "audio_request": {
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
        "speed": 1.0,
        "format": "wav"
      },
      "explicit": false,
      "section_context": "收进三句话",
      "marker_data": null
    },
    {
      "id": "sum_003",
      "text": "点的水平位置，画出来是余弦。",
      "segment_type": "content",
      "audio_request": {
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
        "speed": 1.0,
        "format": "wav"
      },
      "explicit": false,
      "section_context": "收进三句话",
      "marker_data": null
    },
    {
      "id": "end_001",
      "text": "下次忘了公式，就想想这个转圈的点。",
      "segment_type": "content",
      "audio_request": {
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
        "speed": 1.0,
        "format": "wav"
      },
      "explicit": false,
      "section_context": "结尾",
      "marker_data": null
    },
    {
      "id": "end_002",
      "text": "三角函数不是公式，是一个圆。",
      "segment_type": "content",
      "audio_request": {
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
        "speed": 1.0,
        "format": "wav"
      },
      "explicit": false,
      "section_context": "结尾",
      "marker_data": null
    }
  ],
